#saizen@irc.rizon.net

02:15.060 --> 02:17.340
Which of us will be able to keep that ball?

02:17.340 --> 02:18.900
All right, the challenge is on!

02:32.010 --> 02:33.340
Misaki,

02:33.340 --> 02:36.630
today's game will finally decide which one of us is the better player.

02:42.570 --> 02:45.560
I'm looking forward to playing against you, Misaki.

02:51.340 --> 02:56.500
<b>An Elegant Commander</b>

02:51.340 --> 02:56.500
<b>An Elegant Commander</b>

03:15.360 --> 03:16.570
I'm off.

03:16.570 --> 03:19.010
Have a nice day, Pierre-sama.

03:30.050 --> 03:35.350
We will definitely win, and then we'll raise the French flag into the Paris sky.

03:35.940 --> 03:37.380
Let's go, Sleipnir!

03:37.760 --> 03:38.380
Giddy-up!

03:46.980 --> 03:52.820
International Stadium of Paris

03:57.430 --> 03:58.750
Hey, look.

03:58.750 --> 04:00.460
Japan's number 10 is over there.

04:00.460 --> 04:01.740
Tsubasa Ohzora...

04:02.230 --> 04:06.740
That player has more assists than Pierre in this tournament.

04:09.510 --> 04:11.460
And there's the French team!

04:14.460 --> 04:16.170
Pierre isn't here.

04:31.810 --> 04:36.220
Hmph. I'm France's ace striker!

04:36.220 --> 04:38.000
Not Pierre!

04:39.610 --> 04:40.590
Misaki.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.260
Pierre...

04:44.800 --> 04:49.350
Let's settle things like we promised during this tournament.

04:49.350 --> 04:50.510
Let's do that.

04:51.390 --> 04:52.850
Let's have a good game.

04:52.850 --> 04:53.440
Yeah.

05:03.430 --> 05:05.020
Tsubasa Ohzora.

05:05.020 --> 05:06.220
Go easy on me.

05:06.220 --> 05:07.830
Likewise.

05:12.930 --> 05:14.400
Pierre-sama.

05:15.960 --> 05:19.290
The president has come to see you today.

05:19.290 --> 05:21.250
Please follow me.

05:21.250 --> 05:22.260
Understood.

05:23.060 --> 05:24.420
I'll see you on the pitch.

05:27.520 --> 05:31.820
He said the president of France came in person to cheer him on.

05:31.820 --> 05:34.030
Seriously?! That's unbelievable!

05:35.210 --> 05:37.290
Elle Sid Pierre...

05:38.380 --> 05:42.750
It looks like a midfield battle against Pierre for you in today's game.

05:42.750 --> 05:43.500
Yeah.

05:51.500 --> 05:55.500
Germany won the first game 6-1?

05:55.500 --> 05:56.690
Wakabayashi.

05:57.890 --> 05:59.120
Schneider!

06:01.220 --> 06:04.220
You won't play in this game either?

06:04.810 --> 06:07.260
You're playing against France today.

06:07.820 --> 06:09.630
It'd be best to not underestimate them.

06:12.130 --> 06:15.260
We'll see each other tomorrow for the finals, Wakabayashi.

06:19.260 --> 06:21.960
So that's Schneider, the Young Emperor of Germany, eh?

06:21.960 --> 06:22.830
Yeah.

06:24.300 --> 06:29.170
If he wants to see you in the finals, does that mean we're going to win today?

06:29.170 --> 06:31.260
He's saying, "You better win!"

06:36.650 --> 06:38.710
Goalkeeper: Wakashimazu.

06:38.710 --> 06:43.020
Defenders: Matsuyama, Soda, Jito, Ishizaki.

06:43.020 --> 06:47.910
Midfielders: Ohzora, Misaki, Izawa, Sano.

06:47.910 --> 06:50.460
Forwards: Sorimachi, Hyuga.

06:51.700 --> 06:53.420
Those are the starters.

06:53.420 --> 06:54.650
Sir!

06:54.650 --> 06:57.390
We will be marking two French players:

06:57.390 --> 07:02.040
their forward, Napoléon, and their midfielder, Pierre.

07:02.040 --> 07:04.020
First, you're up against Napoléon, Soda.

07:04.020 --> 07:04.840
Yes!

07:04.840 --> 07:07.740
You've got the big prey, Ace Killer!

07:07.740 --> 07:09.540
Yeah, count on me!

07:09.540 --> 07:11.060
Misaki, you'll have Pierre.

07:11.060 --> 07:13.420
I'm counting on you. Maintain your cover.

07:14.020 --> 07:15.100
Yes!

07:15.980 --> 07:17.900
All right, it's time.

07:17.900 --> 07:20.150
Let's do our best today, too!

07:20.150 --> 07:22.100
Yeah!

07:23.000 --> 07:24.780
All right, come in. Come in.

07:24.780 --> 07:28.160
Sorry to invite myself like this to watch the game.

07:28.160 --> 07:31.060
The more fans we have, 
the more reassured we are.

07:31.060 --> 07:32.100
Exactly.

07:33.840 --> 07:36.100
Oh! I'm the last again, eh?

07:36.100 --> 07:39.430
You're late, uncle. The game's about to start.

07:39.430 --> 07:45.140
Oh, sorry, sorry. If I had left the store earlier, my wife would've scolded me.

07:45.140 --> 07:48.810
But who can possibly work with Japan playing in the semifinals?

07:48.810 --> 07:50.280
Ah, it's starting!

07:50.280 --> 07:52.360
This is the semifinal match of the 
International Junior Youth Championship.

07:52.360 --> 07:54.720
It's Japan vs. France, and both teams are now entering.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.140
Ah, here they come!

07:56.860 --> 07:58.660
Tsubasa-kun...

07:58.660 --> 08:01.220
Ohzora Tsubasa, Elle Sid Pierre.

08:01.230 --> 08:04.730
Both captains look determined.

08:09.660 --> 08:13.200
Pierre-sama, good luck!

08:22.780 --> 08:26.020
Pierre-sama's so handsome!

08:30.070 --> 08:33.990
The International Stadium of Paris is swarming with French supporters.

08:33.990 --> 08:37.640
Today, even the president of France is watching.

08:39.450 --> 08:41.580
Both teams are now on the pitch.

08:44.180 --> 08:47.270
Oh! Even the French Air Force is cheering them on!

08:50.010 --> 08:54.020
It's the Japanese team making their first appearance
in the International Junior Youth Tournament

08:54.020 --> 08:57.790
versus the French team with a proud soccer tradition.

08:57.790 --> 09:02.370
Who will be up against Germany in tomorrow's final?

09:05.350 --> 09:08.020
Both teams are getting into their positions.

09:12.680 --> 09:15.890
Misaki, we're finally challenging each other on the pitch.

09:17.140 --> 09:20.020
Pierre, I've been looking forward to this.

09:25.280 --> 09:26.540
It's starting.

09:29.660 --> 09:33.390
The second semifinal starts with France kicking off.

09:40.740 --> 09:43.900
Elle Sid Pierre moves up the field with his flawless dribbling.

09:43.900 --> 09:46.440
But Misaki is there to challenge him.

09:46.440 --> 09:47.940
Here I come, Pierre.

09:49.100 --> 09:50.180
Come on, Misaki!

09:51.420 --> 09:52.940
Take this!

09:52.940 --> 09:54.630
Hyuga does a sliding tackle!

09:55.330 --> 09:57.700
But Pierre avoids it by jumping!

09:57.700 --> 09:58.620
Yes!

09:59.100 --> 10:01.830
And now he collides with Misaki in open air.

10:01.830 --> 10:03.580
The duel looks as if it's a draw!

10:06.540 --> 10:07.670
Misaki!

10:07.670 --> 10:08.540
Pierre!

10:08.540 --> 10:09.540
What?!

10:10.130 --> 10:13.540
Oh! Ohzora cuts in and steals the loose ball!

10:14.010 --> 10:14.900
Tsubasa-kun!

10:15.690 --> 10:20.900
Japan succeeded in stealing the ball from Pierre, thanks to their three-man combination!

10:21.420 --> 10:22.900
Tsubasa?

10:23.690 --> 10:25.460
Nice, Tsubasa!

10:25.780 --> 10:27.820
Way to go, Tsubasa!

10:28.700 --> 10:34.390
Now the Japanese captain, Ohzora, is dribbling and attacking the French team up the middle.

10:34.820 --> 10:37.370
What have you done to Pierre-sama?

10:37.370 --> 10:40.860
Pierre-sama, are you hurt?

10:40.860 --> 10:43.890
The French are hurrying toward the ball,

10:43.890 --> 10:46.220
so what will Ohzora Tsubasa do now?

10:46.220 --> 10:46.860
Let's go!

10:46.860 --> 10:48.820
Catch me if you can!

10:54.530 --> 10:56.460
He got through!

10:57.420 --> 11:02.800
Ohzora Tsubasa gets through easily with fast steps and dribbling!

11:02.800 --> 11:03.340
Damn it!

11:03.340 --> 11:04.380
All right!

11:12.480 --> 11:14.780
Oh! Ohzora Tsubasa...

11:15.620 --> 11:18.700
He's doing his specialty kick, the Drive Shot!

11:20.940 --> 11:22.860
Go in!

11:42.660 --> 11:44.660
Go in!

11:49.580 --> 11:51.430
It's in!

11:51.430 --> 11:53.700
Goal!

11:55.710 --> 11:59.850
He succeeded in shooting the ball into the French goal!

12:03.160 --> 12:05.630
Ohzora Tsubasa did it.

12:05.630 --> 12:07.540
Japan scored the first goal!

12:09.550 --> 12:10.780
Tsubasa...

12:11.680 --> 12:12.540
He did it!

12:12.540 --> 12:13.810
Nice shot!

12:13.810 --> 12:15.760
You're incredible, Tsubasa-kun!

12:15.760 --> 12:17.540
Looks like clear sailing from here!

12:17.540 --> 12:19.360
Yay, you did it, Tsubasa!

12:19.360 --> 12:20.540
They scored the first goal!

12:22.180 --> 12:25.580
He was fast in scoring, wasn't he?

12:26.100 --> 12:28.540
Way to go, Tsubasa-kun!

12:31.060 --> 12:33.060
Tsubasa Ohzora,

12:33.060 --> 12:35.030
and Taro Misaki.

12:35.030 --> 12:39.060
I've prepared a special present for you.

12:39.060 --> 12:41.540
The game resumes with France having the ball.

12:43.740 --> 12:46.310
The ball reaches Pierre immediately.

12:46.310 --> 12:49.490
And to his right, Napoléon comes forward.

12:50.580 --> 12:51.990
Pierre passes the ball.

12:51.990 --> 12:52.930
Here I go!

12:52.930 --> 12:56.100
France's ace striker, Napoléon, goes on the attack!

12:56.100 --> 12:57.500
I won't let you!

12:57.500 --> 13:00.120
Soda, who's marking Napoléon, is coming.

13:01.100 --> 13:03.890
I'll get back the goal they scored on us!

13:03.890 --> 13:05.220
Pass!

13:06.940 --> 13:09.420
Pass it back, Napoléon!

13:09.950 --> 13:11.230
You're telling me to pass?!

13:15.030 --> 13:20.420
Oh! Soda took out Napoléon's ankle with his razor tackle!

13:21.220 --> 13:23.140
Hey, you! That was a foul!

13:23.260 --> 13:24.580
What?!

13:24.580 --> 13:25.840
Play on!

13:25.840 --> 13:27.440
France now has a chance.

13:27.440 --> 13:30.540
The referee doesn't take out his card, and France has the advantage.

13:30.540 --> 13:33.020
And Pierre goes forward while dribbling.

13:33.020 --> 13:34.300
I won't let you go on like that.

13:34.300 --> 13:37.300
Misaki closely follows Pierre.

13:37.880 --> 13:39.710
I'll stop you!

13:39.710 --> 13:41.780
And here's Ishizaki!

13:42.340 --> 13:43.780
It's mine!

13:44.860 --> 13:45.860
Eh? He disappeared!

13:46.350 --> 13:49.520
Oh! What a fast jump!

13:49.520 --> 13:51.900
Pierre is hanging in the air!

13:55.780 --> 13:56.780
It hurts!

13:58.900 --> 14:01.640
Nothing seems to stop this man.

14:01.640 --> 14:04.270
He's showing us the elegance of French soccer.

14:04.270 --> 14:07.380
The artist of the field, Elle Sid Pierre.

14:07.380 --> 14:10.460
You're so beautiful, Pierre-sama!

14:10.460 --> 14:13.140
Très bien, Pierre-sama!

14:13.660 --> 14:16.110
I can't have them being shocked right now.

14:16.110 --> 14:19.540
I've still got a whole lot of soccer to show them!

14:23.750 --> 14:27.510
Oh! Pierre is getting into position to fire a long shot!

14:31.440 --> 14:34.620
My present is a Slider Shot!

14:39.510 --> 14:41.660
The ball is heading straight for the Japanese goal!

14:48.500 --> 14:51.710
The keeper, Wakashimazu, dives to catch the ball!

14:51.710 --> 14:52.940
I've got it!

15:01.850 --> 15:05.300
It's in! Goal!

15:07.110 --> 15:11.860
The ball looked like it would be caught, but it dropped and fell into the right corner!

15:13.050 --> 15:14.950
This is incredible!

15:14.950 --> 15:21.800
With this unique shot from Pierre, France instantly tied the game 1-1!

15:23.860 --> 15:26.860
You're so beautiful, Pierre-sama!

15:32.900 --> 15:34.860
Pierre!

15:38.800 --> 15:43.860
Oh! A fight is breaking out on the other side of the field!

15:43.860 --> 15:45.740
Soda! Stop it!

15:45.740 --> 15:47.900
He started it!

15:47.900 --> 15:49.900
Calm down, Napoléon!

15:54.230 --> 15:55.610
This is...

15:56.820 --> 16:00.350
Both players get a warning. 
They each get a yellow card.

16:05.830 --> 16:06.980
Damn it!

16:06.980 --> 16:09.370
Don't get hot headed like this, Soda.

16:09.370 --> 16:10.370
Yeah...

16:14.450 --> 16:16.440
Sorry, everyone.

16:16.440 --> 16:19.420
I'm supposed to be marking Pierre.

16:20.000 --> 16:23.610
And I never thought Pierre had that kind of shot.

16:24.600 --> 16:27.660
Come on! It's only starting! We're still tied!

16:27.660 --> 16:30.090
Yeah, that's right!

16:30.090 --> 16:33.780
We'll score another goal and eliminate France!

16:33.780 --> 16:35.530
Yeah!

16:38.240 --> 16:39.510
Wakashimazu!

16:40.620 --> 16:43.840
I'll take revenge for this goal.

16:46.090 --> 16:47.760
Hyuga-san...

16:49.720 --> 16:54.330
Even though we won yesterday's game against Argentina,

16:54.330 --> 16:57.300
I still let Diaz get a hat trick.

16:58.300 --> 17:03.020
Why are they still leaving the goalkeeper position to me?

17:03.020 --> 17:06.220
Why isn't Wakabayashi taking my place?

17:07.690 --> 17:13.690
Wakashimazu, the only thing you're missing now is international experience.

17:13.690 --> 17:18.410
While going up against the world's top players, you will gain solid skills.

17:18.410 --> 17:21.740
It might be painful now, but you'll get through it.

17:22.900 --> 17:27.410
It's a tied game with Japan kicking off.

17:28.700 --> 17:30.740
Let's do this, Misaki-kun!

17:31.760 --> 17:33.580
Okay, Tsubasa-kun!

17:34.750 --> 17:36.080
Ohzora Tsubasa,

17:36.080 --> 17:37.190
Misaki Taro.

17:37.190 --> 17:39.750
The Golden Duo is on the move!

17:46.420 --> 17:48.210
That's splendid passing.

17:51.460 --> 17:54.180
What a beautiful combination!

17:57.730 --> 17:58.940
Hyuga-kun!

17:58.940 --> 18:01.940
Ohzora Tsubasa passes over to Hyuga.

18:04.660 --> 18:05.820
Here I go.

18:05.820 --> 18:08.660
I'll be the one to score this goal!

18:09.540 --> 18:11.980
He's dribbling toward the French goal with full power!

18:11.980 --> 18:14.940
But Pierre is looking to steal the ball!

18:20.390 --> 18:21.140
What?!

18:24.340 --> 18:25.990
I'll win this game.

18:25.990 --> 18:28.340
I'll be the one to play against Schneider!

18:30.460 --> 18:32.830
Pierre continues forward while dribbling.

18:32.830 --> 18:35.340
His marker, Misaki, arrives.

18:35.340 --> 18:38.340
Misaki, I'm sorry, but I won't hand over the ball.

18:39.340 --> 18:40.430
Pierre!

18:41.540 --> 18:42.910
But...

18:44.290 --> 18:45.980
Misaki was passed!

18:46.440 --> 18:48.980
Pierre is serious!

18:48.980 --> 18:50.560
That was a foul!

18:50.560 --> 18:52.010
What was the referee looking at?!

18:52.010 --> 18:53.370
No, that was only a collision.

18:53.370 --> 18:54.180
It was a foul!

18:54.180 --> 18:55.380
Okay, it was a foul.

18:59.220 --> 19:01.020
Will Pierre, who just dribbled past his marker, Misaki,

19:01.020 --> 19:04.020
aim for the goal with his Slider Shot again?

19:05.180 --> 19:08.660
Oh! This time, Ohzora is heading in his direction!

19:10.860 --> 19:13.880
Pierre continues relentlessly,

19:13.880 --> 19:15.900
but Ohzora isn't about to lose steam!

19:15.900 --> 19:18.900
Come on, Pierre-sama!

19:22.360 --> 19:25.100
They clash together at the same time!

19:26.490 --> 19:30.070
The lost ball is high up in the air!

19:31.380 --> 19:33.540
Come on, Napoléon!

19:33.540 --> 19:36.010
Pierre passes with an overhead kick!

19:36.820 --> 19:38.420
Napoléon runs at full speed,

19:39.140 --> 19:41.120
but his marker, Soda, is there!

19:40.620 --> 19:41.730
It's mine!

19:41.730 --> 19:43.100
Like hell!

19:44.480 --> 19:46.700
There's a violent collision in midair!

19:47.720 --> 19:49.700
Napoléon doesn't shoot!

19:50.330 --> 19:53.200
The goal keeper, Wakashimazu, catches the ball with a firm grip.

19:53.200 --> 19:54.270
All right...

19:54.700 --> 19:57.320
Oh? What's this?

19:57.320 --> 20:00.700
Soda committed a foul on that play just now.

20:02.220 --> 20:06.980
What? He gets another yellow card!

20:07.460 --> 20:10.740
It's Soda's second yellow card of the game!

20:11.410 --> 20:13.870
While in the midair duel with Napoléon,

20:13.870 --> 20:17.460
Soda supposedly elbowed Napoléon in the face.

20:17.980 --> 20:22.130
Soda, a player on the Japanese team, has just been sent off!

20:22.980 --> 20:24.010
It can't be...

20:25.100 --> 20:26.400
That's ridiculous!

20:26.400 --> 20:28.060
I didn't do that on purpose!

20:28.060 --> 20:29.710
Why am I being sent off?!

20:29.710 --> 20:30.340
Calm down!

20:31.150 --> 20:33.640
Soda is protesting wildly!

20:33.640 --> 20:38.540
But a referee does not take back a decision once it's made.

20:45.580 --> 20:48.440
Even though the first half has just begun,

20:48.440 --> 20:52.800
Japan will have to play the rest of the game with only ten players.

20:52.800 --> 20:56.100
In addition, France has been given a penalty kick.

20:56.100 --> 20:59.540
Japan's in big trouble!

20:59.540 --> 21:03.440
I didn't do anything that deserves a sending off!

21:03.440 --> 21:04.630
That was awful!

21:10.660 --> 21:14.100
Referee, what Soda just did was not on purpose.

21:14.100 --> 21:17.380
Captain Ohzora Tsubasa went up to protest,

21:17.380 --> 21:19.100
but the judgment from the referee is absolute.

21:19.100 --> 21:22.980
If he protests too much, he's in danger of receiving a card himself.

21:24.580 --> 21:27.810
Soda's elbow hit his face by accident!

21:27.810 --> 21:30.180
I can't accept your decision!

21:30.780 --> 21:34.000
Ohzora Tsubasa is protesting strongly.

21:34.610 --> 21:36.180
Tsubasa-kun...

21:45.290 --> 21:49.370
Oh, the referee just put a hand into his shirt pocket.

21:49.370 --> 21:52.290
Will Ohzora Tsubasa receive a yellow card?

21:52.290 --> 21:55.170
There's also a red card in there...

22:03.820 --> 22:09.820
Preview

22:04.580 --> 22:06.220
It's the semifinal match against France.

22:06.220 --> 22:09.400
Soda gets sent off soon after the game starts,

22:09.400 --> 22:13.510
and we, the Japanese team, have to fight with ten players.

22:13.510 --> 22:14.990
Pierre's magnificent passing,

22:14.990 --> 22:16.760
Napolèon's Cannon Shot...

22:16.760 --> 22:19.290
France's offense is unstoppable.

22:19.290 --> 22:21.110
But we'll win for sure!

22:21.110 --> 22:24.420
We'll get to the finals for Soda's sake!

22:24.420 --> 22:26.350
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:26.340 --> 22:33.900
The Yellow Card Of Regret

22:26.350 --> 22:28.030
The Yellow Card Of Regret.

22:28.030 --> 22:29.130
Look forward to it!

22:29.130 --> 22:31.540
Let's aim for tomorrow! Get goal!

22:34.340 --> 22:38.140
tsumiageru jibun no takasa wa

22:34.340 --> 22:38.140
My skill keeps on growing.

22:38.140 --> 22:42.500
dare ni mo kimerarenai

22:38.140 --> 22:42.500
Nobody can measure it.

22:42.500 --> 22:46.140
komiageru jibun no yowasa wo

22:42.500 --> 22:46.140
The weakness that grows inside me,

22:46.140 --> 22:50.500
dare ni mo miserarenai

22:46.140 --> 22:50.500
I can't let anyone see it.

22:50.500 --> 22:58.460
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

22:50.500 --> 22:58.460
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

22:58.460 --> 23:04.500
aa ima susumu yo

22:58.460 --> 23:04.500
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:10.380 --> 23:14.180
tondekuru koishi wo haratte

23:10.380 --> 23:14.180
I ward off the pebble flying towards me,

23:14.180 --> 23:18.540
bai no hayasa de kaesu

23:14.180 --> 23:18.540
And return it with twice as much speed.

23:18.540 --> 23:22.180
yandeiru kotori wo hirotte

23:18.540 --> 23:22.180
I pick up an ill little bird,

23:22.180 --> 23:26.500
ooki na sora ni kaesu

23:22.180 --> 23:26.500
and return it to the wide open sky.

23:26.500 --> 23:34.460
aa tada maketakunai sono kimochi de

23:26.500 --> 23:34.460
Ah. It's just, I feel like I never want to lose...

23:34.460 --> 23:40.460
aa ima susumu yo

23:34.460 --> 23:40.460
Ah. Right now, I'll move forward.

23:45.940 --> 23:50.460
ima daseru subete no chikara de

23:45.940 --> 23:50.460
Using all the strength I have,

23:50.460 --> 23:54.020
koukai wa shitakunai

23:50.460 --> 23:54.020
without feelings of regret...

23:54.020 --> 24:01.500
ima daseru subete no chikara de saikou no kachi

23:54.020 --> 24:01.500
Using all the strength I have, to the ultimate victory.
